   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "jp": "「こっちに何か近づいてくる……！」",
   "en": "Something's coming this way...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "jp": "「連中もゲートに気づいたか」",
   "en": "So they noticed the gate too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "jp": "「<アーマードモジュール>……！@　でも、連邦軍の機体じゃない……<ＤＣ>残党かな」",
   "en": "<アーマードモジュール>...!@But not Federation ones... <ＤＣ> remnants, maybe?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "jp": "「彼らも君と同じように@　ラ・ギアスへ召喚されたのだ」",
   "en": "They were summoned to La Gias@just like you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "jp": "「誰が、何のためにそんなことを……」",
   "en": "Who would do that, and why...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "jp": "「君達を呼び寄せたのが何者か知らないが……@　地上から召喚した者達を傭兵として使う@　連中が存在している」",
   "en": "I don't know who called you all here...@but there are those who use people@summoned from the surface as mercenaries.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "jp": "「で、そいつらはあんたと敵対してるってわけ？」",
   "en": "And those guys are your enemies, I take it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "jp": "「察しがいいな。その通りだ」",
   "en": "You're perceptive. Exactly.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "jp": "「……一応、筋は通ってるか」",
   "en": "...Well, I guess that adds up.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "jp": "「どうする？　@　君は後退してもらっても構わんが……」",
   "en": "What will you do?@I won't object if you choose to fall back...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "jp": "「冗談！　売られた喧嘩は買わなきゃ、@　リューネ・ゾルダークの名が泣くってものよ！」",
   "en": "As if! If I backed down from a fight,@I'd be a disgrace to the name Lüne Zoldak!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "jp": "「それに、あたしのヴァルシオーネを見て@　向かってくるＤＣ残党なら、容赦はしない！」",
   "en": "Besides, if DC remnants still come at me@after seeing my Valsione, I won't hold back!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "jp": "「リューネ……それに、ヴァルシオーネか。@　いい度胸だ。やられるなよ」",
   "en": "Lüne... and the Valsione, was it?@You've got nerve. Don't get shot down.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "jp": "「後続はなしか……偵察部隊だったらしいな」",
   "en": "No reinforcements... Seems it was a recon unit.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "jp": "「ヤンロン、何であんたはさっきの連中に@　狙われてたの？」",
   "en": "Yang Long, why were those guys@after you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "jp": "「どちらかと言えば、狙いは君だった。@　何が召喚されたか、様子を見に来たのだ。@　僕と同じようにな」",
   "en": "If anything, they were after you.@They came to see what had been summoned.@Same as me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "jp": "「様子を見に来たって……」",
   "en": "To see what had been summoned...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "jp": "「ここ最近、原因不明のゲートが@　開かれるという騒ぎが多発していてな……」",
   "en": "Lately, there's been a rash of incidents@where gates open for no known reason...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "jp": "「多くの地上人が突発的に@　召喚されてしまっているんだ」",
   "en": "Many surface dwellers have been@suddenly summoned here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "jp": "「色々訳ありみたいだね。@　詳しく説明してくれる？」",
   "en": "Sounds complicated.@Mind filling me in?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "jp": "「ああ、君もこの地へ来てしまった以上、@　事情を知っておく必要があるな。@　少し話は長くなるが……」",
   "en": "Yes. Now that you've come here,@you need to know what's going on.@It's a bit of a long story, though...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "jp": "神聖ラングラン王国　マラカ州　セミール湾",
   "en": "Holy Kingdom of Langran@Malaka Province, Semir Bay",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "jp": "「……以上が、現在の神聖ラングラン王国の状況だ」",
   "en": "...That is the current situation@in the Holy Kingdom of Langran.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "jp": "「要するに、このラングランって国が、@　王都で起きたテロのせいで無政府状態に@　なっちゃったと」",
   "en": "So basically, this country Langran fell into@anarchy because of a terrorist attack@in the royal capital.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "jp": "「で、隣のシュテドニアス連合が攻め込んで来て……@　カークス将軍ってのが立ち上がったってわけね」",
   "en": "Then the Schtedonias Union next door invaded...@and this General Kirkus guy rose up, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "jp": "「ああ。@　現状のラングランにおいてまとまった勢力と@　呼べるのは、カークス将軍の部隊だけだ」",
   "en": "Yes. Right now, General Kirkus's forces are@the only organized power left in Langran.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "jp": "「僕は、将軍とは意見を異にするが……@　ラングランを解放するため、共に@　シュテドニアスと戦っている」",
   "en": "I don't share the General's views...@but I'm fighting alongside him against@Schtedonias to liberate Langran.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "jp": "「さて、リューネ……君はどうする？」",
   "en": "Now then, Lüne... What will you do?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "jp": "「地上に帰る方法はあるの？」",
   "en": "Is there a way back to the surface?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "jp": "「召喚系の魔法は、かなりの魔力を@　必要とするからな……使える人間は限られる」",
   "en": "Summoning magic requires a great deal@of magical power... Few people can use it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "jp": "「有名な所では、@　大神官イブンに銀の魔法師カテキス……@　他には、今は亡きフェイルロード殿下」",
   "en": "Well-known ones include High Priest Ibn@and Catekis the Silver Sorcerer...@as well as the late Prince Feyroad.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "jp": "「じゃ、魔法が使える人間がいれば、@　割と簡単に戻れるの？」",
   "en": "So if I find someone who can use magic,@getting back would be pretty easy?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "jp": "「この混乱した状況下で、そうはいかんだろうな。@　神殿が敵に制圧されていたり、神官達が@　疎開している可能性もある」",
   "en": "Not in this chaos, I'm afraid.@The temples may be under enemy control,@or the priests may have evacuated.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "jp": "「なら、すぐに帰れるってわけじゃないんだ。@　ところで……マサキは今、どこにいるの？@　ラ・ギアスへ行くって言ってたけど」",
   "en": "So I can't go home right away, huh?@By the way... where's Masaki now?@He said he was heading to La Gias.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "jp": "「彼の行方はわからない。カークス将軍の部隊は@　ともかく、散り散りになった他の同志達と@　連絡を取ることさえもままならぬ状況なのだ」",
   "en": "I don't know where he is. Aside from General@Kirkus's forces, we can't even contact the@other comrades who were scattered.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "jp": "「そう……マサキのことだから、@　どこかで迷子になってるかも知れないけど……」",
   "en": "I see... Knowing Masaki, he's probably@gotten himself lost somewhere...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "jp": "「あいつとの合流を望むのなら、@　今の僕では力になれそうにない。@　任務があるからな」",
   "en": "If you want to reunite with him,@I'm afraid I can't help you right now.@I have a mission.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "jp": "「任務って……どんな？」",
   "en": "A mission...? What kind?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "jp": "「遊軍として敵を混乱させることだ。@　まず北に向かい、シュテドニアスの@　中継基地の一つを叩く」",
   "en": "To sow confusion among the enemy as a@roving unit. First, I'll head north and hit@one of Schtedonias's relay bases.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "jp": "「あんただけで、それを？」",
   "en": "You're doing that alone?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "jp": "「ああ。@　炎の魔装機神グランヴェールならば、可能だ」",
   "en": "Yes. With Granveil, the Masoukishin of Fire,@it's possible.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "jp": "「ふ～ん……じゃ、あたしもついてくよ」",
   "en": "Hmm... Then I'm coming with you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "jp": "「気楽に決めてくれるな。@　僕を信用し、そう決断した理由は何だ？」",
   "en": "Don't decide something like that so lightly.@Why trust me? What made you choose this?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "jp": "「まず、あんたがマサキと同じく、魔装機神の@　パイロットだってこと。融通は利かなさそうだけど、@　悪い奴じゃないってわかるよ」",
   "en": "First, you're a Masoukishin pilot, just like@Masaki. You seem pretty inflexible, but I can@tell you're not a bad guy.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "jp": "「この世界へ来たばかりのあたしに、@　妙な真似をしなかったしね」",
   "en": "Plus, you didn't try anything funny with me@when I'd only just arrived in this world.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "jp": "「………」",
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "jp": "「それと……ＤＣの残党が召喚されてるなら、@　事はあたしにも関係あるんだ。@　放っておくわけにはいかない」",
   "en": "Also... if DC remnants are being summoned here,@then this concerns me too.@I can't just leave it alone.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "jp": "「ほう、一応は考えているわけだ」",
   "en": "Oh? So you've given it some thought, at least.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "jp": "「あと、あんたと一緒に行動していれば、@　マサキと合流できるかも知れないしね」",
   "en": "Besides, if I stick with you, I might be able@to meet up with Masaki.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "jp": "「いいだろう。では、僕についてくるがいい」",
   "en": "Very well. Then follow me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  }
 ]
}